==Battleground==
*40 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
*50 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1~2.67 seconds<sup>30f~80f</sup>.
*50 [[Croco]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1~2.33 seconds<sup>30f~70f</sup>.
*20 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~8 seconds<sup>100f~240f</sup>.
*10 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*15 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a very easy stage. Bring [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], about 3 meatshields, and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]]. After the peons start coming, spam everything claim your win.

